{
    "title": "Xfinity",
    "description": "Your Xfinity experience, enhanced.\r\n\r\nEasily manage all your services in one place with the Xfinity app. Plus discover the power of NOW.\r\n\r\nNOW is a simple new way to get internet and mobile. It\u2019s just what you want, and nothing you don\u2019t. With all-in monthly pricing. Backed by Xfinity.\r\n\r\nXfinity customers also get:\r\n\r\n\u2022\t24/7 real-time support anytime you need it.\r\n\u2022\tTools to help you seamlessly activate your equipment and test your internet speed.\r\n\u2022\tXfinity Rewards. Enjoy special perks, unique experiences, and product benefits just for being a customer.\r\n\r\nCustomers who rent our equipment get even more:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tEverything you need to manage your account, all in one place \u2014 pay your bill, view your plan details, change or upgrade your services, and more.\r\n\u2022\tPersonalized tools and tips to help improve WiFi performance.\r\n\u2022\tAdvanced Security to protect your devices and help keep loved ones safe online.\r\n\u2022\tParental controls so you can set family-safe browsing and pause WiFi to any connected device.\r\n\u2022\tUltimate control with tools to help you set up your WiFi, assign user profiles, and get help improving the performance of every connected device.\r\n\r\nGetting started is simple. All you need is your Xfinity ID and the password that you set up when you signed up for Xfinity.\r\n\r\nNeed help signing in?\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIf you don\u2019t have an Xfinity ID yet, create one here: xfinity.com/getstarted\r\n\u2022\tLook up your existing Xfinity ID: xfinity.com/id\r\n\u2022\tOr reset your Xfinity password: xfinity.com/password\r\n\r\nLearn more about your options related to \u2018California Civil Code \u00a71798.135: Do Not Sell My Info\u2019 at xfinity.com/privacy/manage-preference",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your Xfinity experience, enhanced.<br><br>Easily manage all your services in one place with the Xfinity app. Plus discover the power of NOW.<br><br>NOW is a simple new way to get internet and mobile. It\u2019s just what you want, and nothing you don\u2019t. With all-in monthly pricing. Backed by Xfinity.<br><br>Xfinity customers also get:<br><br>\u2022\t24/7 real-time support anytime you need it.<br>\u2022\tTools to help you seamlessly activate your equipment and test your internet speed.<br>\u2022\tXfinity Rewards. Enjoy special perks, unique experiences, and product benefits just for being a customer.<br><br>Customers who rent our equipment get even more:<br><br>\u2022\tEverything you need to manage your account, all in one place \u2014 pay your bill, view your plan details, change or upgrade your services, and more.<br>\u2022\tPersonalized tools and tips to help improve WiFi performance.<br>\u2022\tAdvanced Security to protect your devices and help keep loved ones safe online.<br>\u2022\tParental controls so you can set family-safe browsing and pause WiFi to any connected device.<br>\u2022\tUltimate control with tools to help you set up your WiFi, assign user profiles, and get help improving the performance of every connected device.<br><br>Getting started is simple. All you need is your Xfinity ID and the password that you set up when you signed up for Xfinity.<br><br>Need help signing in?<br><br>\u2022\tIf you don\u2019t have an Xfinity ID yet, create one here: xfinity.com/getstarted<br>\u2022\tLook up your existing Xfinity ID: xfinity.com/id<br>\u2022\tOr reset your Xfinity password: xfinity.com/password<br><br>Learn more about your options related to \u2018California Civil Code \u00a71798.135: Do Not Sell My Info\u2019 at xfinity.com/privacy/manage-preference",
